sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Kb as Kubelet
    participant CRI as Container runtime
    participant K as Kernel
    participant C as Container
    API->>Kb: pod assigned to this node
    Kb->>CRI: create the sandbox
    CRI->>K: clone() with new namespaces
    Note over K: PID, network, mount, UTS, IPC, user — isolation is per-namespace, not all-or-nothing
    CRI->>K: create the cgroup, write the limits
    K-->>CRI: cgroup ready
    CRI->>K: pull and mount the image layers
    CRI->>C: exec the entrypoint inside those namespaces
    C-->>Kb: running
    loop while it runs
        K->>K: CFS enforces cpu.max, memory controller enforces the ceiling
        Kb->>C: probes decide ready, live, or restart
    end
    alt memory ceiling hit
        K->>C: OOM kill inside the cgroup, not system-wide
    end
